  "chapterId": "puc1-physics-04-laws-of-motion",
  "topicId": "puc1-physics-04-laws-of-motion.t2",
  "stem": {
   "en": "The momentum of a particle varies as p = (2t² + 3t) kg m/s. The force on it at t = 2 s is:"
  },
  "options": [
   {
    "en": "7 N"
   },
   {
    "en": "14 N"
   },
   {
    "en": "8 N"
   },
   {
    "en": "11 N"
   }
  ],
  "answer": 3,
  "explanation": {
   "en": "F = dp/dt = 4t + 3 = 11 N at t = 2 s."
  },
  "exams": [
   "PUC",
