  "topicId": "puc1-physics-04-laws-of-motion.t4",
  "stem": {
   "en": "A block slides down a rough incline of 37° with μ_k = 0.5. Its acceleration is (g = 10 m/s², sin 37° = 0.6, cos 37° = 0.8):"
  },
  "options": [
